  "description": "Microsoft Graph-backed group resolver for Orleans.Lattice.Membership.Entra. Resolves a caller's full transitive Entra group membership when a token's groups claim overflows, using an app-only Microsoft Graph client whose access token is acquired, cached, and transparently refreshed via the MSAL confidential-client token cache with a single shared in-flight refresh. Isolates the Microsoft Graph and MSAL dependencies from the core Entra authenticator package.",
